+
+- Source bound with `bind-review-source` (inv-2, base 60e287aadd08af10779df39e625200f28d4b7fa3, head 985d1eb6faaa2e92e4e01f430f0f2c07618bf6ad); both verified with `git rev-parse --verify <sha>^{commit}`. Caller checkout HEAD was 985d1eb6 with a clean status when read; nothing was switched or edited.
